#  Professional MEAN Stack Portfolio

A full-stack dynamic portfolio application built using Angular 21, Node.js, Express, and MongoDB. This project follows the MVC architecture to ensure scalability and clean code.

# Key Features
* Dynamic Data: Projects and skills are fetched directly from a MongoDB database.
* MVC Architecture: Separated logic into Models, Controllers, and Routes for better maintenance.
* RESTful API: Professional backend endpoints for managing portfolio data.
* Responsive UI: Modern design built with Angular Standalone Components.

# Tech Stack
* Frontend: Angular 21, TypeScript, Bootstrap.
* Backend: Node.js, Express.js.
* Database: MongoDB (Mongoose ODM).
* Security: Environment variables (.env) & CORS enabled.

# Installation & Setup
1. Clone the repository:
   git clone https://github.com/NOoOUR14/portfolio.git
2. Setup Backend:
   * Go to portfolio-backend folder.
   * Run npm install.
   * Create a .env file and add your MONGO_URI.
   * Start server: node server.js.
3. Setup Frontend:
   * Go to angular-portfolio-app-main folder.
   * Run npm install.
   * Start app: ng serve.

